post.description:
Server-Sent Events streaming endpoint.

نقطة نهاية البث المباشر باستخدام SSE.

Returns text/event-stream with chunks:
    event: token
    data: {"chunk": "...", "done": false}

    event: tool_call
    data: {"name": "...", "arguments": {...}}

    event: tool_result
    data: {"success": true, "output": {...}}

    data: [DONE]
